{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓劇《再婚皇后》男星朱智勛與合作16年的Blitzway事務所約滿後，決定離巢自立門戶，準備成立個人公司。</p><p>身為Blitzway主要股東的他，持股市值在短短8個月內減少約32.33億韓圜（約1,890萬港元）。</p><p>Blitzway昨日發聲明表示尊</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T03:07:11.000393+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T02:58:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T03:00:33.517345+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T03:00:33.517345+00:00","content_hash":"9fa41fd0225f16cdd4b0d97e5bba1305344379fb5ba4194c1bb5ce3f26eb6ed0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}